<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7497" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνα-σπαστός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drawn up,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				382
			</span></i>: but mostly, <i>dragged up the country,</i> of tribes
			compelled to emigrate into Central Asia, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνασπαστοὺς ποιῆσαι τοὺς Παίονας ἐς
					τὴν Ἀσίην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					5.12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τούτους ἐξ Αἰγύπτου ἀ. ἐποίησαν
					παρὰ βασιλέα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.204
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				6.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				32
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ἀ. κατοικίζειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.93
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθὺς ἀ.</span>
			<i>removing</i> hastily, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				2.53.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of a door or
			gate, <i>drawn back, opened</i> from inside, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				1186
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
				Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἀ.</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμάντες</span>) <i>latchets,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				12
			</span></i>. 
			<i><span class="en">
				543f
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
